# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0017001> (device utilizes material)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0017001> "X device utilizes material Y means X and Y are material entities, and X is capable of some process P that has input Y.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0017001> "utilizes")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0017001> "device utilizes material"@en)

