AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0005029> "A root primordium may arise from cells of a pericycle (PO:0006203) in a root in most seed plant (pericyclic lateral root primordium; PO:0025492), from cells of an endodermis (PO:0000252) in ferns and some seed plants (non-pericyclic lateral root primordium: PO:0025493), or from cells of a shoot axis (PO:0025029), in the case of a basal root primordium (PO:0025479) or shoot-borne root primordium (PO:0025480). Transition from root primordium to root occurs with the formation of a root cap (PO:0020123), shortly after the development of a root apical meristem (PO:0020147).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0005029> "root primordium")
