# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_0000597> (plant quality trait)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Gramene:pankaj_jaiswal") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:9781118313718") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "TO:Laurel_Cooper") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_0000597> "A plant trait (TO:0000387) that contributes to the overall utility, nutritional, or economic value of a plant, plant structure (PO:0009011) or plant product")
